stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: RequestAsync (requester -> addressee)
    Pending --> Accepted: AcceptAsync (by addressee)
    Pending --> Declined: DeclineAsync (by addressee)
    Pending --> [*]: CancelRequestAsync (by requester)
    Declined --> Pending: RequestAsync again\n(old row deleted, fresh Pending row created)
    Accepted --> [*]: RemoveAsync (either side — "unfriend")

    note right of Pending
        FriendRequest notification
        dispatched to addressee on entry
    end note
